OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal after honeymoon items
OL,4,Astolen from newlyweds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police investigation is under way
OL,7,Fafter a newly-married couple reported
OL,8,Fitems ordered for their honeymoon had
OL,9,Fbeen stolen from a communal hallway.
OL,11,FThe parcels, containing clothes worth
OL,12,Fabout #500, were taken from the
OL,13,FPinnacle Apartments on School Road in
OL,14,FHove, in the early hours of last
OL,15,FFriday, Sussex Police said.
OL,17,FThe couple had received notifications
OL,18,Fconfirming the items had been
OL,19,Fdelivered, but when they returned from
OL,20,Ftheir wedding, every package had
OL,21,Fdisappeared.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
